steps.description:
Create `src/investigators/hypothesis-types.ts` with the core types for the hypothesis verification layer:

- `HypothesisCategory`: union type covering the main root-cause classes ('missing-secret' | 'bad-db-endpoint' | 'dns-failure' | 'image-pull-failure' | 'config-error' | 'oom-kill' | 'connectivity-failure' | 'readiness-failure' | 'generic-crash' | 'missing-service')
- `EvidenceAssessment`: { supporting: Evidence[], contradicting: Evidence[], missingDecisive: string[] }
- `Hypothesis`: { id: string, symptom: string, rootCause: string, category: HypothesisCategory, evidenceAssessment: EvidenceAssessment, confidence: number, confidenceRationale: string, specGapRecommendations: string[], sourceFindings: string[] }
- `HypothesisSet`: { symptomKey: string, symptomDescription: string, hypotheses: Hypothesis[], topHypothesis: Hypothesis | null }
- `HypothesisVerificationResult`: { hypothesisSets: HypothesisSet[], metadata: { totalHypotheses: number, totalSymptomsAnalyzed: number } }

Update `src/investigators/index.ts` barrel to export the new types. Follow existing conventions: doc comments on every type, import types with `import type`, `.js` extensions on imports.
